ight:18px;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Validate pages; merge native/OCR text.&lt;br/&gt;Recheck source, policy and current lease.&lt;br/&gt;Publish atomic Azure SQL passages.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=58;spacingBottom=8;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#20384f;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="525" y="1594" width="350" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="purpose-icon-publish" parent="publish" value="" vertex="1" style="shape=image;imageAspect=1;aspect=fixed;image=data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns%3D%22http%3A%2F%2Fwww.w3.org%2F2000%2Fsvg%22%20width%3D%2240%22%20height%3D%2240%22%20viewBox%3D%220%200%2040%2040%22%3E%3Crect%20x%3D%221%22%20y%3D%221%22%20width%3D%2238%22%20height%3D%2238%22%20rx%3D%228%22%20fill%3D%22white%22%20stroke%3D%22%23315f8a%22%20stroke-opacity%3D%220.3%22%2F%3E%3Cg%20transform%3D%22translate%288%208%29%22%20fill%3D%22none%22%20stroke%3D%22%23315f8a%22%20stroke-width%3D%221.8%22%20stroke-linecap%3D%22round%22%20stroke-linejoin%3D%22round%22%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22m12%202%209%204v6c0%205-9%2010-9%2010S3%2017%203%2012V6l9-4Z%22%2F%3E%3Cpath%20d%3D%22m7%2012%203%203%207-7%22%2F%3E%3C%2Fg%3E%3C%2Fsvg%3E;"><mxGeometry x="157.0" y="12" width="36" height="36" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="handoff" parent="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:16px;line-height:20px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;Searchable passages available to RAG&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:14px;line-height:18px;margin-top:8px&quot;&gt;Retained page references and source revisions.&lt;br/&gt;Retrieval and answer generation are a separate pipeline.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=58;spacingBottom=8;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontColor=#20384f;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry x="425" y="1832" width="550" height="170" as="geometr